{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04542","headline":"奉和圣制过晋阳宫应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制过晋阳宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太原俗尚武，高皇初奋庸。\n星轩三晋躔，土乐二尧封。\n北风遂举鹏，西河亦上龙。\n至德起王业，继明赖人雍。\n六合啓昌期，再兴广圣踪。\n传呼大驾来，文物如云从。\n连营火百里，纵观人千重。\n翠华渡汾水，白日临崒峰。\n枌榆恩赏洽，桑梓旧情恭。\n往运感不追，清时惜难逢。\n诗发尊祖心，颂刊盛德容。\n愿君及春事，廻舆绥万邦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}